| RN + laws | 60.3 | 52.5 | 52.7 | 76.9 | 93.7 | 86.8 | 62.6 | 50.6 | 67.02 |
| RN + statistics | 58.6 | 51.8 | 50.0 | 72.7 | 91.6 | 85.8 | 64.0 | 53.5 | 65.99 |
